| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Developer / implementer   | Quickstart, §4.0, §4 phases, §6               | pick the track, write the plan/implementation, run checks |
| Reviewer                  | §4 Phase 6–8 (refutation-default)             | try to break the acceptance criteria, file findings       |
